OL,3,GNEWSAChurch deacon jailed for decades
OL,4,Aof sexual abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA church deacon and youth group leader
OL,7,Ffrom north London has been sentenced to
OL,8,Feight and a half years after grooming
OL,9,Fand sexually assaulting young men over
OL,10,Fseveral decades.
OL,12,FJohn Grant, 77, of Hornsey, was
OL,13,Fconvicted of three counts of sexual
OL,14,Fassault, six counts of indecent assault
OL,15,Fand two counts of causing another
OL,16,Fperson to engage in non-penetrative
OL,17,Fsexual activity between 1970 and 2008.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
