OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAChurch deacon jailed for decades
OL,4,Aof sexual abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Emma Deacon KC said Grant carried
OL,7,Fout "a sustained manipulation of two
OL,8,Fyoung men" who he "knew to be
OL,9,Fvulnerable, and to whom you presented
OL,10,Fyourself as a benevolent figure, well
OL,11,Frespected in the community".
OL,13,FWood Green Crown Court heard he will
OL,14,Fserve up to half his sentence in prison
OL,15,Fand the rest on licence.
